    "snippet": "---\ntitle: Fatima Soriano Out, Lawrence Villanueva and 8-Year-Old Boy In as Beneficiaries of AJ Perez' Eyes\nauthor: Name\ndate: 2011-04-22\n---\nFatima Soriano Out, Lawrence Villanueva and 8-Year-Old Boy In as Beneficiaries of AJ Perez' Eyes\n\nTwo days ago, Dr. Mae Singson announced that Fatima Soriano, AJ's family's chosen beneficiary to receive AJ's cornea, was incompatible for the transplant. Today, Sta. Lucia Eye Bank awarded AJ's left cornea to one lucky beneficiary named Lawrence Villanueva, this according to a report by Ni\u00f1a Corpus for TV Patrol.\n\nLawrence, who has been suffering from poor eyesight on his left eye for more than three years now, could not contain his happiness on this very good news.\n\n\"God really works in different ways talaga,\" the 28-year-old Lawrence said.\n\nLawrence, who personally claimed AJ's left cornea, had his successful eye operation today.\n\nDr. Menguita Padilla, President of Sta. Lucia Eye Bank praises the Perez family in their decision to donate AJ's cornea despite the pain they're going through right now due to the lost of their son.\n\n\"Humahanga ako sa mga tao na, imagine, nagdadalamhati ka, naghihinagpis ka, namatay ang anak mo, pero naisip mo pa na mag-donate,\" Dr. Padilla said.\n\nDr. Menguita also revealed that AJ's right cornea will be given to an unnamed 8-year-old boy.\n\nflo mamamatay lahat ng pamilya mo at ikaw maiiwan\u2026dahil baliw ka ok lang sayo,,,ok lang din sa amin paki ba,,,mamamatay pamilya mo flo\u2026mamamatay sana now na\u2026at maiiwan ka dahil masaya ka sa mangyayari..\n\nmagpamental ka na flo\u2026hehe baliw ka d mo alam yan\u2026at baka d mo matanggap pero baliw ka\u2026at walang kwenta..\n\nnabalitaan ko na sa manila memorial park sa paranaque ililibing si AJ\u2026. magkakaroon ako ng chance na masulyapan sya sa huling sandali\u2026. hindi naman ako fan ni AJ pero napapanood ko sya sa abs at na touch"
